WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:16.655
"Oh no!" Jemima cried.

2
00:00:16.656 --> 00:00:20.253
"Where are Dora's babies?"

3
00:00:20.254 --> 00:00:23.847
"Quack!" Jemima's baby said.

4
00:00:23.848 --> 00:00:27.242
He was looking at the chicken house.

5
00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:30.918
Henny Penny was in the chicken house.

6
00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:33.639
So were Dora's ducklings!

7
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:44.074
They were playing with the chicks.

8
00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:47.858
"Ducklings! Come here!" Jemima called.

9
00:00:47.859 --> 00:00:53.645
But ducklings and chicks ran everywhere.

10
00:00:53.646 --> 00:00:56.284
Henny Penny frowned.

11
00:00:56.285 --> 00:01:00.192
She clucked loudly.

12
00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:08.259
"Ducks do not belong in the chicken house!"

13
00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:16.666
Jemima gathered all the ducklings.

14
00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:22.938
They walked past the pond.

15
00:01:22.939 --> 00:01:26.862
"Water!" The biggest duckling quacked.

16
00:01:26.863 --> 00:01:33.102
He jumped in.

17
00:01:33.103 --> 00:01:43.196
The others jumped in too.

18
00:01:43.197 --> 00:01:46.559
"No!" Jemima cried.

19
00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:54.805
The five ducklings swam and splashed.

20
00:01:54.806 --> 00:02:02.863
They swam in the reeds.

21
00:02:02.864 --> 00:02:06.152
Then the ducklings swam across the pond.

22
00:02:06.153 --> 00:02:09.019
"No!" Jemima cried.

23
00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.610
"Wait for me!"

24
00:02:12.611 --> 00:02:14.140
Splash!

25
00:02:14.141 --> 00:02:19.394
Jemima rushed after the ducklings.

26
00:02:19.395 --> 00:02:21.370
Splash!

27
00:02:21.371 --> 00:02:33.612
So did her duckling.
